+Feature: Editing safety
+  As a user editing a todo
+  I want the app to handle focus transitions safely
+  So that deleting a todo via empty edit never throws a DOM error in any browser
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Empty edit deletion under focus transitions
+
+    Scenario: Deleting a todo via empty edit does not throw when focusout fires after keydown
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+      And the edit input receives a focusout event
+      Then no todo "Buy groceries" exists
